      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "yulia",
      "t": "Они уже год не общаются. Она из дома ушла.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "yulia",
      "t": "А он с девочками разговаривать не научился.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So after Ignatyev throws Ilona out of his office, Yulya tips her off about his one weak spot: his estranged daughter Galina, a ballerina and vegetarian who hasn't spoken to him in a year. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "yulia",
      "t": "Пока!",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
